    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: temperate or warm dry plains.\n\nEmberthistle is a russet weed crowned by a barbed seedhead that glows like a banked coal after sunset. The plant thrives where grassfires have passed, pushing new growth through warm ash within days. Crushing the prepared seedhead produces a glowing paste that spellcasters smear across the fingers or lips. The next time you deal fire damage within 1 minute, increase one damage roll by 1d4. The dose is then expended.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
